	Hello!

At the moment I am poking around with the EWS88MT card and the thing has
129 mixer controls which is quite some pages of alsamixer strips. Just
an idea: it would be nice to be able to specify which controls are
relevant and which are not. It could be added to .asoundrc ctl.
definition (if anybody would like the syntax to get even more complex:) 
or .alsamixerrc. A simple alsamixer-conf would be nice.

Take care,

	Miha...





